# The commit of mica whose docs/design/release-lock/vectors this repository's
# tests/vectors equals, checked by `bun src/container.ts vectors`.
# Known and deliberate at this commit: ten vectors carry the download URL
# bun-linux-uefi-x64.zip, a board-rename sweep artefact (mica 91fce7c8) for an
# asset Bun does not publish. It is inert -- nothing downloads a fixture -- and
# it is pinned here rather than silently carried. Move this pin to the commit
# that repairs it; the gate will not notice on its own, because a pin is a
# statement about one commit and not about the newest one.
REPOSITORY=mica
